  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>The creations are made in the image of the creator.</em><br>\n<strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Silvermind.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose another race (subject to GM discretion). You count as both a silvermind and that race for any effects related to race, including selecting feats, qualifying for magic items or favored class bonuses, and so on. This does not cause a silvermind to gain the chosen races type or subtypes.</p>\n<p>For example, if you choose dwarf, you are considered both a silvermind and a dwarf for the purpose of taking traits, feats, how spells and magic items affect you, and so on.</p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> This feat is meant to allow silverminds to emulate “being another race” and should generally only allow for races that are regularly available, not as a means of qualifying for niche monster exclusive options.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/silvermind#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
